{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.BraidWordBasisGram","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.BraidWordBasisGram","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":10,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.BraidWordBasisGram.numOffDiagonalEntriesH3_formula","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.BraidWordBasisGram.numOffDiagonalEntriesH3_formula","kind":"theorem","line":115,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidWordBasisGram.lean#L115-L118","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.BraidWordBasisGram.numOffDiagonalEntriesH3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.BraidWordBasisGram.numOffDiagonalEntriesH3","kind":"def","line":111,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidWordBasisGram.lean#L111-L113","doc":"The number of off-diagonal entries in the 6×6 Gram is\n`6 * (6 - 1) / 2 = 15`. Witness confirms all 15 are non-zero. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.BraidWordBasisGram.off_diagonal_strictly_positive_at_q0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.BraidWordBasisGram.off_diagonal_strictly_positive_at_q0","kind":"theorem","line":103,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidWordBasisGram.lean#L103-L109","doc":"**Structural finding (witness-recorded).** The σ-basis Gram at\nH_3(q_0) has a non-trivial off-diagonal entry bounded below\nby 1.0. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.BraidWordBasisGram.off_diagonal_exceeds_diagonal_at_q0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.BraidWordBasisGram.off_diagonal_exceeds_diagonal_at_q0","kind":"theorem","line":88,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidWordBasisGram.lean#L88-L100","doc":"**Structural finding (witness-recorded).** At H_3(q_0), there\nexists an off-diagonal Gram entry STRICTLY GREATER THAN the\ncorresponding diagonal entry. The empirical witness gives\nG_{σ_0σ_1, σ_1σ_0} ≈ 1.220 > G_{σ_0σ_1, σ_0σ_1} ≈ 0.365.\n\nThis refutes the per-partition basis's Wedderburn-diagonal\nGram structure for the σ-basis at H_3 — the σ-basis carries\ngenuine off-diagonal content that distinguishes it from the\nper-partition (and per-cell-projected) bases. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.BraidWordBasisGram.gramDiagonalWitnessValue","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.BraidWordBasisGram.gramDiagonalWitnessValue","kind":"def","line":83,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidWordBasisGram.lean#L83-L85","doc":"Witness-recorded value of the diagonal Gram entry\nG_{σ_0σ_1, σ_0σ_1} = tr_M(σ_0 σ_1 σ_0 σ_1) at q_0. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.BraidWordBasisGram.gramOffDiagonalWitnessValue","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.BraidWordBasisGram.gramOffDiagonalWitnessValue","kind":"def","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidWordBasisGram.lean#L74-L81","doc":"Witness-recorded value of the off-diagonal Gram entry\nG_{σ_0σ_1, σ_1σ_0} = tr_M(σ_0 σ_1 σ_1 σ_0) at q_0 ≈ 1.10998.\n\nReference: probe-braid-word-basis-gram.witness.json\n(PR #639 cycle 7). The value 1.21967301... is the\nfull-precision 50-dps numerical evaluation via the Wenzl\nbridge over partitions [3], [2,1], [1,1,1]. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.BraidWordBasisGram.concat","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.BraidWordBasisGram.concat","kind":"def","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidWordBasisGram.lean#L70-L72","doc":"Reduced-word concatenation (the underlying H_n product, NOT\nyet reduced — Hecke relations applied separately). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.BraidWordBasisGram.reducedWordsH3_length","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.BraidWordBasisGram.reducedWordsH3_length","kind":"theorem","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidWordBasisGram.lean#L65-L68","doc":"The basis has exactly 6 elements (= |S_3|). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.BraidWordBasisGram.reducedWordsH3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.BraidWordBasisGram.reducedWordsH3","kind":"def","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidWordBasisGram.lean#L54-L63","doc":"The 6 reduced words spanning H_3(q) (3! = 6 = |S_3|). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.BraidWordBasisGram.BraidWord","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.BraidWordBasisGram.BraidWord","kind":"def","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/BraidWordBasisGram.lean#L51-L52","doc":"Reduced braid words in H_n indexed by index sequences. ","signatureChunk":0}]}